{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "67712d30-18c6-8f76-9cd1-05e6b70f236d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T15:42:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, parking violations, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:38:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, um, I'm calling about a parking ticket. It's for my mother, she's in her eighties, and I handle her things. Is this the, uh, the water department? Or the Tax Assessor, I'm not sure which one I got."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This is the Finance Department. We process parking violations. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, yes. It says here, okay, it was issued down by, um, where the old Almy's used to be. Well, not Almy's, that's gone, the lot near Washington Square. The meter was broken. I put in coins, four quarters, and the thing never registered anything. The screen was blank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Can you read me the ticket number, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:39:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on. It's, um, there's a few numbers on here. Is it the one on top or the one by the barcode?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The citation number, usually printed near the top right of the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The top right. Seven, seven, four, one, nine, zero, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have it here. The citation is for an expired meter, and the balance is fifty dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, but it wasn't expired, it was broken. So I can appeal that, right? How long does an appeal take? I don't understand if I pay it, do I still appeal, or do I appeal first and then pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You may do either. If you appeal, the citation is reviewed by the hearing office, and that generally takes a few weeks. If you pay now, the matter is closed, and it is generally treated as an admission. I would not want to state an exact number of days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. Okay. And that's the, um, the Middletown hearing office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:40:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, ma'am. The Newport hearing office, through this department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, Newport, right, sorry. I was thinking of the Middletown one, my cousin had something out there. Okay. Well, my mother wants it done and over with. She doesn't want a letter coming to the house. So I think I'll just pay it. Can I do that now, on the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:40:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can take a card payment. Whenever you are ready, please give me the card number, and then the expiration date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get the card. Okay. It's six, zero, one, one. [pause] One, one, one, one. [pause] One, one, one, one. [pause] One, one, one, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me read that back: 6011 1111 1111 1117. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:40:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. And the expiration is zero nine, twenty-seven. So September of twenty twenty-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero nine, twenty-seven. Thank you. And you are authorizing a payment of fifty dollars and zero cents."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, fifty dollars. Wait, so that's the whole thing? There's no extra fee on top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The balance on the citation is fifty dollars, and that is the amount I am processing. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The payment has gone through. You will receive a receipt by mail to the address on the registration. Please keep it with your records."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's paid and there's no appeal now. I was a little mixed up on that. And if the meter is still broken, who do I tell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can report the meter to the Department of Public Services. I can transfer you if you like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:41:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all right, I'll just write it down. Thank you for your help, Ms. Whitcomb. If I need to reach you, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:42:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very good. Thank you for calling, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T15:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
